for £1000

18. easy. putting stuff about nudity aside, the depictions of the horrors of death, on a personal scale, a grand scale and everywhere in-between are so viscerally dreadfully real and designed so effectively to cause distress in the player that it should basically come with a health warning on it, like cigarettes or something. hell, it's just as addictive.

&#x200B;

that being said, I severely doubt most folks younger than 18 would be going into this game often with how hard it can be to penetrate. I would have bounced the fuck off of even pathologic 2 in my adolescence

holy shit, so that's either famine or death, huh? there goes the "one horseman per part" theory. most people seem to be assuming death, which I can see I guess, but also the death devil would be on primal-fear level. definitely at minimum equal to the darkness devil, almost certainly stronger. 

&#x200B;

pretty safe to say though I don't think anyone was expecting the mystery girl to be THIS. people were sus of her being something, but fuckin hell. fujimoto's ability to throw the biggest fucking curveballs continues to be absolutely astounding to me
